{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_jayce_hextech": {
        "attack": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>海克斯科技电容<>：出手前按战况切换锤（近战）和炮（远程），间隔<#ffb900ff>6秒<>，每次<#ffffffff>移速+25%<>。变炮后下次攻击使目标<#ffdd8eff>护甲和魔抗-20%<>（<#ffb900ff>5秒<>）；变锤获得<#ffdd8eff>护甲和魔抗+25%<>（<#ffb900ff>4秒<>）。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】锤：把敌人击退向己方，造成<#a974ffff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>，对英雄另加<#f5f5f5ff>8%最大生命值真实伤害<>；冷却时<#ff9028ff>闪电领域<>每<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>造成<#a974ffff>14<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>。炮：之后3次攻击<#ceff99ff>攻速+120%<>，造成<#ff9028ff>120%<>攻击力伤害。",
        "ult": "【附加包】变为炮形态，放置加速之门（<#ffffffff>移速+40%<>，<#ffb900ff>3秒<>），向能击杀或血最少的英雄射出加速电能球，造成<#ff9028ff>140<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>161%<><#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>，爆炸范围更大。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_jayce_hextech": {
        "attack": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>海克斯電容器<>：出手前依戰況切換錘（近戰）和砲（遠程），間隔<#ffb900ff>6秒<>，每次<#ffffffff>跑速+25%<>。變砲後下次攻擊使目標<#ffdd8eff>物防和魔防-20%<>（<#ffb900ff>5秒<>）；變錘獲得<#ffdd8eff>物防和魔防+25%<>（<#ffb900ff>4秒<>）。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】錘：把敵人擊退向己方，造成<#a974ffff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>，對英雄另加<#f5f5f5ff>8%最大生命真實傷害<>；冷卻時<#ff9028ff>離子領域<>每<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>造成<#a974ffff>14<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>。砲：之後3次攻擊<#ceff99ff>攻速+120%<>，造成<#ff9028ff>120%<>攻擊力傷害。",
        "ult": "【附加包】變為砲形態，放置中子加速裝置（<#ffffffff>跑速+40%<>，<#ffb900ff>3秒<>），向能擊殺或血最少的英雄射出加速電能球，造成<#ff9028ff>140<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>161%<><#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>，爆炸範圍更大。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_jayce_hextech": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] <#ff9028ff>Hextech Capacitor<>: before an attack he switches between hammer (melee) and cannon (ranged) as the fight needs, every <#ffb900ff>6s<> at most, gaining <#ffffffff>25% move speed<>. After turning cannon his next attack cuts the target's <#ffdd8eff>armour and magic resist by 20%<> for <#ffb900ff>5s<>; turning hammer gives him <#ffdd8eff>+25% armour and magic resist<> for <#ffb900ff>4s<>.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Hammer: knocks an enemy back toward his side for <#a974ffff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, plus <#f5f5f5ff>8% of a champion's max health as true damage<>; on cooldown <#ff9028ff>Lightning Field<> deals <#a974ffff>14<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around him every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>. Cannon: <#ff9028ff>Hyper Charge<> - his next 3 attacks gain <#ceff99ff>120% attack speed<> and deal <#ff9028ff>120%<> AD.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] Turns into the cannon, places the Acceleration Gate (<#ffffffff>40% move speed<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>) and fires an accelerated orb at the champion it can kill, else the lowest: faster and farther, <#ff9028ff>140<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>161%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> in a larger burst."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_jayce_hextech": {
        "attack": "[애드온] <#ff9028ff>마법공학 축전기<>: 공격 전에 상황에 따라 해머(근접)와 캐논(원거리)을 바꾸며, 전환 대기시간 <#ffb900ff>6초<>, 전환 시 <#ffffffff>이동 속도 +25%<>. 캐논 전환 후 다음 공격은 <#ffb900ff>5초<> 동안 대상의 <#ffdd8eff>방어력과 마법 저항력 -20%<>, 해머 전환 시 <#ffb900ff>4초<> 동안 <#ffdd8eff>방어력과 마법 저항력 +25%<>.",
        "skill2": "[애드온] 해머: 적을 아군 쪽으로 밀쳐내며 <#a974ffff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>, 챔피언에게 <#f5f5f5ff>최대 체력 8% 고정 피해<> 추가; 대기 중이면 <#ff9028ff>전류 역장<>이 <#ffb900ff>0.5초<>마다 <#a974ffff>14<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>. 캐논: 다음 공격 3회 <#ceff99ff>공격 속도 +120%<>, 공격력의 <#ff9028ff>120%<> 피해.",
        "ult": "[애드온] 캐논으로 변해 가속 관문을 설치하고(<#ffffffff>이동 속도 +40%<> <#ffb900ff>3초<>) 처치 가능하거나 체력이 가장 낮은 챔피언에게 가속된 구체를 발사해 <#ff9028ff>140<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>161%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>, 폭발 범위 증가."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_jayce_hextech": {
        "attack": "【アドオン】<#ff9028ff>ヘクステック・コンデンサー<>：攻撃の前に戦況でハンマー（近接）とキャノン（遠隔）を切り替え、間隔<#ffb900ff>6秒<>、<#ffffffff>移動速度+25%<>。キャノン後の次の攻撃は対象の<#ffdd8eff>物理防御と魔法防御-20%<>（<#ffb900ff>5秒<>）、ハンマーで<#ffdd8eff>物理防御と魔法防御+25%<>（<#ffb900ff>4秒<>）。",
        "skill2": "【アドオン】ハンマー：敵を味方側へノックバックし<#a974ffff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>、チャンピオンに<#f5f5f5ff>最大体力8%の確定ダメージ<>；CD中は<#ff9028ff>ライトニング<>が<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>ごとに<#a974ffff>14<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>。キャノン：次の3回の攻撃は<#ceff99ff>攻撃速度+120%<>、攻撃力の<#ff9028ff>120%<>。",
        "ult": "【アドオン】キャノンに変形しアクセルゲートを設置（<#ffffffff>移動速度+40%<>、<#ffb900ff>3秒<>）、倒せるか体力の最も低いチャンピオンへ加速した球を放ち<#ff9028ff>140<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>161%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>、爆発範囲拡大。"
      }
    }
  }
}
